 vent and the “FUNNEST RIDE” in Northern California. Some tell us it’
 s the finish line party\, all-you-can-eat BBQ\, gourmet sides\, unlimited 
 local IPA beers and wine. Others claim it’s our scenic wine country rout
 es and full-service rest stops. While many riders simply enjoy the SAG (Su
 pport & Gear) vehicles with off-duty cop/cyclists and the police swag give
 aways. Regardless of your reason(s)\, it has been your cycling support tha
 t makes it possible for Chaplains to serve our community.
