BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Goatlandia invites the Community to "Reggae to the Rescue!"
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T170000
UID:21054671762e25ed21c538449b836ddc@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Party with a Purpose: Goatlandia Invites the Community to "Reg
 gae to the Rescue"—An Afternoon of Music\, Compassion & Farm Animal Fun 
 Sonoma County's favorite reggae band\, Sol Horizon\, headlines Goatlandia'
 s biggest "fun-raising" celebration of the year on Saturday\, August 22.FO
 R IMMEDIATE RELEASE SEBASTOPOL\, Calif. — Goatlandia Farm Animal Sanctua
 ry & Education Center invites the community to trade the traditional black
 -tie gala for ?ip-?ops\, island colors\, and good vibes at Reggae to the R
 escue\, its annual fundraising celebration\, on Saturday\, August 22\, 202
 6\, from 1:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. at the sanctuary's beautiful 36-acre prope
 rty in Sebastopol. VIP guests are welcomed from 1:00–2:00 p.m.\, with Ge
 neral Admission beginning at 2:00 p.m. and continuing through 5:00 p.m. Th
 e event brings together live music\, rescued farm animals\, delicious food
  and drinks\, and a shared commitment to creating a more compassionate wor
 ld. Event details are available at https://www.goatlandia.org/events/reg
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/goatlandia-invites-the-
 community-to-reggae-to-the-rescue
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
